        "text": "Hello, everyone. I'm Hannah, and today I'm going to tell you about the Saturday mornings I spend with a group of volunteers looking after our local river. I joined last spring because I wanted to spend more time outdoors, and I thought I'd just be picking up litter. In fact, we do all sorts of things, from watching wildlife to checking the condition of the water."
