        "text": "Everyone records what they find. I used my phone on my first day, but my hands were wet and the screen was difficult to see. Now I write everything in a waterproof notebook, which is much more practical. Back at home, I type the information into a form on the group's website. It doesn't take long, and then all the volunteers can see what's been happening along the river."
